    "title": "Basketball Recap: Cheyenne Mountain Skates Past Banning Lewis Academy with Ease - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Team Reports ,\n10 hours ago Winning is always nice, but doing so behind a season-high score is even better (just ask Cheyenne Mountain). They took their game on Friday with ease, bagging a 65-20 victory over the Banning Lewis Academy Stallions. That result was just more of the same for these two, as the Red-Tailed Hawks also won the last time the pair played back in December of 2024. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
